<p>
We attended the town hall on the topic <a href="https://www.jessicabellmpp.ca/_town_hall_how_are_we_going_to_protect_our_bike_lanes">"How are we going to protect our bike lanes?"</a>
It was wonderful to see hundreds of people thinking about concrete ways that they could help make things better.
I loved seeing all sorts of people there, and even more that our 10-year-old daughter stood up to host a breakout session on a topic she cares about: supplies and repairs during protests.
</p>

